7dc18c","quote":"We could face potential product liability or warranty claims relating to our products, including the components thereof, which could reduce market adoption, result in reputation damage, and result in significant costs and liabilities, which would reduce our profitability.","context":"●","section":"The uncertainty in global economic conditions could negatively affect our results of operations.","block":65,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"b65b8b2509298374809e221851f4116734240d04b52fc6dbf91374dd66075904","quote":"Our operations expose us to litigation, tax, environmental, and other legal compliance risks.","context":"●","section":"The uncertainty in global economic conditions could negatively affect our results of operations.","block":67,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"f6cd6c1749baea0ec5c6b06d43ef9b68fef1fd80ea15d6a3c4ffa82e25a87ac3","quote":"Our failure to introduce new products and product enhancements that respond to customer and end consumer demand, and any broad market acceptance of new technologies introduced by our competitors, could adversely affect our business.","context":"●","section":"The uncertainty in global economic conditions could negatively affect our results of operations.","block":70,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"fe70dea4ba623614761125b3058bc7423da71288853e3af8fdc16371b356d957","quote":"We may not be able to adequately protect our proprietary intellectual property and technology and we may need to defend ourselves against intellectual property infringement claims.","context":"●","section":"The uncertainty in global economic conditions could negatively affect our results of operations.","block":72,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"51c329990f815423715a2e65367cc59bd5c4cf79da3fe28af88827d7adaa5c76","quote":"If our electronic data is compromised, or we experience a failure in our information technology or storage systems, our business could be significantly harmed.","context":"●","section":"Any acquisitions that we complete may dilute stockholder ownership interests in the Company, may have adverse effects on our financial condition and results of operations and may cause unanticipated liabilities.","block":76,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"ec908ca2257d4f157233cd9d106fff261043878aa8fe870b6b2e199d6c114e02","quote":"Our ability to raise capital in the future may be limited, which could make us unable to fund our capital requirements and our stockholders may be diluted by future securities offerings.","context":"●","section":"Any acquisitions that we complete may dilute stockholder ownership interests in the Company, may have adverse effects on our financial condition and results of operations and may cause unanticipated liabilities.","block":78,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001903596-26-000075","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-17","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001894954","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1894954/000190359626000075/xpon_10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef.bin","sha256":"24c1f8162a620cc7408cf1688d38e6da2cba00a30eca4f8faef55c8695be27ef"}},{"id":"141c21227d27abd9dca47d532070b03a15f28bbe7daff4d3f2617eed3cc1ba18","quote":"We depend on our senior management team and other key employees, and significant attrition within our management team or unsuccessful succession planning could adversely affect our business.","context":"●","section":"Any acquisitions that we complete may dilute stockholder ownership interests in the Company, may have adverse effects on our financial condition and results of operations and may cause unanticipated liabiliti